            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0468" n="368" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg368"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.30/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Smith</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-14T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                                1920—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>12. Your January 8, 4 p.m. You may say informally to Leguia that the Department
                    is taking up his request with the Navy Department.</p>
                <p>Your November 26, 3 p.m.,<anchor n="19" xml:id="d428-f1"/> stated that Leguia
                    desired three naval commissioners though he would prefer one high naval officer.
                    Cable Department exact number of mission now desired by Leguia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
